e who give life and cause death, and to Us is the destination","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"50:44","t":"On the Day the earth breaks away from them [and they emerge] rapidly; that is a gathering easy for Us.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"50:45","t":"We are most knowing of what they say, and you are not over them a tyrant. But remind by the Qur’ān whoever fears My threat.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"51:1","t":"By the [winds] scattering [dust], dispersing [it]","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"51:2","t":"And the [clouds] carrying a load [of water]","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"51:3","t":"And the ships sailing with ease","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"51:4","t":"And the [angels] apportioning [each] matter,","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"51:5","t":"Indeed, what you are promised is true.","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"51:6","t":"And indeed, the recompense is to occur.","j":26,"h":52,"s":51,"a":6,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":52,"surahs":[50,51],"sajdah":false}